internships.jd_text:
中文：
协助策略团队完成日常数据收集、整理与清洗工作，确保数据的准确性和完整性；
使用SQL进行数据查询、提取与分析，生成基础数据分析报表，支撑业务决策；
协助完成数据可视化工作，将分析结果以清晰、易懂的形式呈现；
配合团队完成其他与数据分析相关的辅助工作，参与简单的数据分析项目。
English：
Assist the Strategy team in daily data collection, collation and cleaning to ensure the accuracy and completeness of data;
Use SQL for data query, extraction and analysis, generate basic data analysis reports to support business decisions;
Assist in data visualization work and present analysis results in a clear and understandable form;
Cooperate with the team to complete other auxiliary work related to data analysis and participate in simple data analysis projects.
中文：
学历要求：本科及以上在读，统计学、数学、计算机、信息管理、经济学等相关专业优先；
技能要求：熟练使用SQL，能够自主编写复杂查询语句，完成数据提取与分析；掌握基本数据分析方法，具备基础的数据敏感度；
语言要求：英语熟练，能够流畅阅读英文技术文档，具备基本的英文沟通能力；
实习时间：每周可实习5天，实习周期不少于3个月，能长期稳定实习者优先；
个人素养：工作认真负责、细心严谨，具备良好的逻辑思维能力和团队协作精神，积极主动，乐于学习新技能。

English：
Education Requirement: Undergraduate or above, major in Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, Information Management, Economics or related fields is preferred;
Skill Requirement: Proficient in SQL, able to independently write complex query statements to complete data extraction and analysis; Master basic data analysis methods and have basic data sensitivity;
Language Requirement: Proficient in English, able to read English technical documents fluently and have basic English communication skills;
Internship Time: Able to intern 5 days a week, internship period of no less than 3 months, priority given to those who can intern stably for a long time;
Personal Qualities: Serious and responsible at work, careful and rigorous, with good logical thinking ability and team spirit, proactive and willing to learn new skills.

1.User Operations: Participate in the execution of user acquisition, activation, and retention strategies for the Qatar market, including new-user conversion funnel analysis, repeat-purchase behavior analysis, and churned-user win-back program design. Conduct regular monitoring and root-cause analysis of core user metrics , leveraging AI tools to enhance analytical efficiency and insight depth;
2.Merchandise Operations: Participate in the structural governance and optimization of platform merchandise , including merchant listing coverage management, best-seller and high-potential item identification, category structure analysis, and local-market merchandise strategy benchmarking, with AI-assisted merchandise performance diagnosis and opportunity discovery;
3.Data Analysis: Perform routine data extraction and analysis based on Hive/BI datasets, proficiently applying AI tools  to boost efficiency, and producing in-depth analyses on user segmentation, merchandise performance, and campaign effectiveness to support operational decision-making;
4.Campaign Execution: Participate in the planning, configuration, launch, and post-mortem review of user growth and merchandise marketing campaigns; explore AI applications in campaign design generation, performance forecasting, and retrospective attribution; track campaign ROI and distill reusable methodologies;
Cross-functional Collaboration: Work with Merchandise, Marketing, Fulfillment, and local BD teams to drive the implementation and continuous iteration of operational strategies in the local market.
1.Currently enrolled in a bachelor's degree program or above; available for an internship of 3+ months, with 4+ days per week ;
2.Data + AI capabilities: Solid data analysis skills with proficiency in SQL; strong hands-on ability with AI tools, able to use LLM-based tools  to assist data analysis and day-to-day productivity; 
3.Clear logical thinking and result-driven mindset; able to let data speak, sensitive to anomalies, and proactive in root-cause analysis;
4.English proficiency: Fluent English as a working language, capable of seamless verbal communication and professional English document writing; comfortable working in a multicultural environment; knowledge of or interest in the Middle East market a plus;
5.Prior internship experience in internet user operations, e-commerce/local-life merchandise operations, or overseas business a plus.

1）流程建设及优化：协助搭建业务流程，并结合业务需求进行迭代，借助内部AI工具等进行提效，帮助销售和商家提升运营效率；
2）数据运营：基于数据模板进行数据分析和播报，为项目的进度管控提供数据助力；
3）业务支持：包括问题抽检、case答疑等其他支持性工作。
1) Process Building and Optimization: Assist in establishing business processes, iterating based on actual business conditions, leveraging internal AI tools to improve efficiency and help sales and merchants enhance operational efficiency;
2) Data Operations: Conduct data analysis and reporting based on data templates, providing data support for project progress management;
3) Support Work: Includes quality checks, case Q&A, and other support tasks.
1）本科及以上在读，建议工科或管科专业；
2）有互联网大厂实习经验（3个月及以上），擅长数据处理和流程规则等优化；
3）英文能力优秀，可作为工作语言进行书面及口头沟通；
4）能稳定实习4个月及以上，期间能保证每月20天以上的北京职场线下办公；
5）主动性好，有探索欲，认真负责。
1) Undergraduate degree or higher, preferably from engineering or management disciplines;
2) Prior internship experience at a major internet company (3 months or more), specialized in data processing and process/rule optimization;
3) Excellent English proficiency, able to use it as a working language for written and verbal communication;
4) Willing to intern for 4 months or longer, ensuring at least 20 days of in-office work in Beijing per month during the period;
5) Proactive, curious, and diligent.
